  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I would like to see an event menu in the VRChat HUD that lists all the events that are happening in VRChat. Not just the major events, but like ours, a regular event that happens several days each week. I've asked about this, and it was thought to be a great idea, but it's never been implemented. I'm not sure how hard it would be. Just a database of occurring or reoccurring events that people could submit online and have it list in the VRChat HUD. I really hope this happens, because people want to find us, and it's been a pain for new people to find us. They have to do it from other sites like Reedit where they discovered us.",
